- No.

1008
01:32:13,486 --> 01:32:20,085
Get off. Mom, please.
Don't hold me. Don't! Stop.

1009
01:32:21,953 --> 01:32:26,629
Mom, don't. Don't.

1010
01:32:28,877 --> 01:32:33,007
No, no. Oh, God.

1011
01:32:48,229 --> 01:32:51,608
Stop. Stop.

1012
01:32:52,108 --> 01:32:53,985
Stop.

